# Mn3Ga at 350 K: the nuclear starting model for the magnetic demo, derived
# from the published refined structure (Mn3Ga-mag_53_350K_Final_ortho.cif):
# the parent group C m c m, the same cell and positions, no moments, and the
# occupancies at 1. The magnetic order is left for the data to show.
# (c) 2026 Tsung-Han Yang
